  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and putting in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;..equation (i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp; lies are parallel.</p><p>So, roots of equation (i)&nbsp;must be equal</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><span style=\"background-color:null;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:null;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:null;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:null;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:null;\">So, positive&nbsp;value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></span></p>",
